WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.012 --> 00:00:15.898
Ally Mateo stepped away from the food truck.

2
00:00:15.918 --> 00:00:19.659
"What's going on?"

3
00:00:20.079 --> 00:00:20.800
Mateo asked.

4
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:21.980
"A lot!"

5
00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:23.041
Ally whispered.

6
00:00:23.061 --> 00:00:26.682
"First of all, my powers aren't working."

7
00:00:26.702 --> 00:00:30.844
"Maybe you're just upset because—" "Ahh!"

8
00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.886
Just then someone at the truck yelped.

9
00:00:32.906 --> 00:00:34.687
"That sounds like Barry!"

10
00:00:35.047 --> 00:00:35.767
Mateo said.

11
00:00:36.628 --> 00:00:38.049
They rushed back to the truck.

12
00:00:38.069 --> 00:00:39.890
"What happened?"

13
00:00:41.111 --> 00:00:42.532
Ally asked breathlessly.

14
00:00:42.552 --> 00:00:43.853
"Did you get burned?

15
00:00:44.313 --> 00:00:45.014
Are you all right?"

16
00:00:45.034 --> 00:00:48.276
"I'm fine."

17
00:00:48.876 --> 00:00:49.897
Barry looked upset.

18
00:00:49.917 --> 00:00:52.459
"But the stove isn't working."

19
00:00:52.479 --> 00:00:56.301
"Let's check the power line," Mateo said.

20
00:00:58.022 --> 00:01:00.204
They went around to the back of Rolling Ray's.

21
00:01:01.656 --> 00:01:05.577
"Look." Mateo pointed to two lines connected to the truck.

22
00:01:06.257 --> 00:01:07.778
"The power line was cut!

23
00:01:09.078 --> 00:01:10.519
So was the propane line."

24
00:01:11.779 --> 00:01:13.179
Barry gasped.

25
00:01:13.919 --> 00:01:15.280
"Who would do that?"

26
00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:20.801
"Someone who wants to stop you from entering the contest," Julius said.

27
00:01:20.821 --> 00:01:23.542
"How come you know so much about it?"

28
00:01:24.302 --> 00:01:25.783
Barry scowled at Julius.

29
00:01:25.803 --> 00:01:27.503
"Are you the mole?"

30
00:01:27.523 --> 00:01:29.724
"Of course not!

31
00:01:30.184 --> 00:01:34.014
I would never—" Julius began to protest, but Ally jumped in.

32
00:01:34.034 --> 00:01:36.296
"It's not Julius, Barry.

33
00:01:37.257 --> 00:01:39.899
But I'm afraid it's another friend of ours."

34
00:01:39.919 --> 00:01:43.582
"Who?" Mateo and Barry asked at the same time.

35
00:01:44.623 --> 00:01:45.224
Ally gulped.

36
00:01:45.244 --> 00:01:51.249
"Flo." "No way!"

37
00:01:51.549 --> 00:01:52.130
Barry said.

38
00:01:52.150 --> 00:01:55.012
"It's true," Julius said.

39
00:01:56.093 --> 00:01:57.794
Mateo ran a hand through his hair.

40
00:01:57.814 --> 00:01:59.636
"Do you have proof?"

41
00:02:00.972 --> 00:02:04.014
"Julius and I followed her today," Ally said.

42
00:02:04.034 --> 00:02:07.717
"And guess where she went—Pepe's!"

43
00:02:11.059 --> 00:02:12.080
Mateo gasped.

44
00:02:13.080 --> 00:02:14.301
"Why did she go there?"

45
00:02:14.321 --> 00:02:19.004
"There's only one reason that I can think of," Ally said.

46
00:02:19.024 --> 00:02:21.866
"To tell them about our plans."

47
00:02:22.487 --> 00:02:23.087
She sighed.

48
00:02:23.107 --> 00:02:27.470
"It makes me really sad."

49
00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:30.012
"Well, it makes me mad!"

50
00:02:31.485 --> 00:02:32.305
Barry growled.

51
00:02:32.325 --> 00:02:35.267
"I'm going straight to Pepe's to confront them.

52
00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:36.968
They can't steal our recipes!

53
00:02:37.829 --> 00:02:41.091
And then I'm going to text Ray, so he can fire Flo immediately!"

54
00:02:41.812 --> 00:02:43.753
Mateo formed a T with his hands.

55
00:02:43.773 --> 00:02:45.434
"Time out, Barry.

56
00:02:46.014 --> 00:02:49.877
We need solid proof first."

57
00:02:50.417 --> 00:02:51.518
Barry paced around.

58
00:02:51.538 --> 00:02:54.960
"Okay, fine."

59
00:02:55.721 --> 00:02:56.742
He looked at Julius.

60
00:02:57.882 --> 00:03:00.084
"Sorry for accusing you without proof."

61
00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.001
"That's okay."

62
00:03:02.621 --> 00:03:03.361
Julius shrugged.

63
00:03:03.381 --> 00:03:06.704
"The wrong person always gets accused first in spy stories."

64
00:03:08.625 --> 00:03:09.846
"Hmm," Ally said.

65
00:03:09.866 --> 00:03:13.568
"So how do investigators find the right person?"

66
00:03:13.588 --> 00:03:17.071
"They lay a trap," Julius said.

67
00:03:17.091 --> 00:03:20.893
"They get the suspect alone and try to get them to confess."

68
00:03:20.913 --> 00:03:22.835
"I know!"

69
00:03:23.175 --> 00:03:23.715
Ally said.

70
00:03:23.735 --> 00:03:30.120
"Let's ask Flo to come to Ray's house to taste your latest recipe idea, Barry.

71
00:03:31.188 --> 00:03:36.110
Then when we're all together, her heart will soften, and she'll confess everything."

72
00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:41.012
"It might work," Mateo said slowly.

73
00:03:41.873 --> 00:03:42.573
Barry shrugged.

74
00:03:42.593 --> 00:03:44.133
"It can't hurt."

75
00:03:45.434 --> 00:03:46.234
"Let's try it."

76
00:03:47.415 --> 00:03:49.536
Mateo pulled out his phone to text Flo.

77
00:03:50.696 --> 00:03:53.798
A few moments later, he saw a reply bubble on the screen.

78
00:03:53.818 --> 00:03:55.878
"She's writing back!

79
00:03:57.019 --> 00:03:59.340
Oh wait, the bubble went away."

80
00:04:00.448 --> 00:04:03.610
The bubble showed up and disappeared several more times.

81
00:04:03.630 --> 00:04:08.094
"This is kind of suspicious," Julius said.

82
00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:12.277
"She's probably crafting a careful reply to throw us off her trail."

83
00:04:12.297 --> 00:04:14.918
"Wait! She replied!"

84
00:04:15.739 --> 00:04:18.361
Mateo held his phone up: Sure.

85
00:04:18.801 --> 00:04:19.802
See you tomorrow night.

86
00:04:19.822 --> 00:04:23.985
"The trap is set," Ally said.

87
00:04:24.005 --> 00:04:28.228
"That's all well and good, but we have another problem," Barry said.

88
00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:30.761
"The stove is not working.

89
00:04:31.341 --> 00:04:32.922
We need it for the contest."

90
00:04:32.942 --> 00:04:37.524
"I'll text Papi and ask him who we should call," Mateo said.

91
00:04:37.544 --> 00:04:40.385
"Hopefully we can get it fixed quickly."

92
00:04:45.427 --> 00:04:49.428
"I don't get it," Ally said as she and Julius left the field.

93
00:04:49.448 --> 00:04:51.669
"Flo is our friend.

94
00:04:52.170 --> 00:04:54.591
It's one thing to tell Pepe's our recipes.

95
00:04:54.931 --> 00:04:57.652
But cutting power and fuel lines on the truck?

96
00:04:58.636 --> 00:05:00.277
That's a serious thing to do."

97
00:05:00.297 --> 00:05:03.998
"Maybe she didn't do it," Julius said.

98
00:05:05.019 --> 00:05:07.440
"Spies often have co-conspirators."

99
00:05:08.720 --> 00:05:09.861
Ally's jaw dropped.

100
00:05:09.881 --> 00:05:13.022
"You mean there's a whole gang of them?"

101
00:05:13.882 --> 00:05:15.503
"Could be," Julius said.

102
00:05:15.523 --> 00:05:18.845
"Guess you'll find out tomorrow night when she comes to your house."

103
00:05:19.965 --> 00:05:20.605
Ally sighed.

104
00:05:22.026 --> 00:05:26.808
She didn't like to think of Flo like this, as a spy, betraying her coworkers and friends.

105
00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:29.582
And what was Ray going to think about all this?

106
00:05:29.602 --> 00:05:34.044
"Hey, isn't that the show's producer and cameraperson?"

107
00:05:34.425 --> 00:05:38.167
Julius asked, pointing to two people leaving the field ahead of them.

108
00:05:38.187 --> 00:05:40.729
"What are they doing here?"

109
00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:42.950
Ally shrugged.

110
00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:47.793
"They film different locations around town to give viewers a sense of the place."

111
00:05:47.813 --> 00:05:51.035
"Right," Julius said.

112
00:05:53.396 --> 00:05:58.101
When they reached Ray's house, Ally and Julius agreed to make another date for the museum.

113
00:05:58.121 --> 00:06:02.365
"Oh, and text me after you meet with Flo," Julius said.

114
00:06:02.385 --> 00:06:03.907
"I will.

115
00:06:04.267 --> 00:06:05.168
Talk to you later!"

116
00:06:07.951 --> 00:06:09.132
Ally walked into the house.

117
00:06:09.152 --> 00:06:13.876
"I really hope we're wrong about Flo," she thought.

118
00:06:13.896 --> 00:06:17.140
"But I'm definitely not wrong about my powers.

119
00:06:18.317 --> 00:06:23.487
I hope Alpha's powers are working well now because she's the only one who can help me!"
